  "description": "Client SDK for submitting jobs to a WitCloud / OmnibusCloud server and retrieving results: connect, authenticate, run/schedule WitEngine scripts with typed parameters, upload/download blobs, and query job status. Built on OutWit.Cloud.Contracts over WitRPC. 1.3: opt-in persistent sign-in (WitCloudAuthenticator.AttachSessionStore / TryRestoreSessionAsync) over the shared OutWit.Cloud.SecureStorage credential store; document submission and job variable documents (1.2).",
